module v2.lens.witness_cost_locality


data witness_cost_locality_law: String = "One law, two projections: a witness's cost must be denominated in its SUBJECT, never in the ambient system (the same denomination law DESIGN 5 states for failure arms - 'denominated in the corpus, not the change'). Per-PR CI cost is sum over witnesses of depth x breadth x frequency; a witness stays admissible for the continuous per-PR floor only while every factor is repo-independent. Two ambient couplings are detectable from a witness's closure facts: DataBreadth (the closure reaches an ambient-read carrier - the corpus arrives as DATA, so breadth grows with the repo and selection cannot attribute the read, forcing never-skip) and LayerDepth (the closure spans two or more compiler pipeline stages - the round-trip/integration shape whose cost multiplies through the pipeline). Both are the same defect: the witness's evaluation reaches outside its subject. Mocking at the layer boundary cuts both at once - a mock is a bounded fixture standing at the boundary. Integration-class witnesses are not banned; they are SCHEDULED (the nightly lane, a declared budget) instead of continuous, per the signed bounded-input/cost-envelope design: cost drives scheduling, never selection. The complement obligation runs the other way too: mock-based unit witnesses are sound only while mock-vs-real fidelity is itself witnessed, and that fidelity check is inherently integration-class - the scheduled lane is the unit lane's soundness backstop, exactly the affected-set falsifier pattern."

data witness_cost_locality_census_receipt: String = "Census 2026-07-11 (module-grain import-closure BFS over the 732-entry discovery roster, eager-gull-872): Local 483, LayerDepth-only 229, DataBreadth-only 9, both 11. Derivations that HOLD: enforcement/cost_coverage and enforcement/grammar_coverage (the operator-ruled-offline rows, 21-22 min per wide PR receipted on runs 29137081535 and 29142398465) classify DataBreadth+LayerDepth; the excluded test/claim/execution round-trips classify LayerDepth; sampled unit rows (access_validation, base64_rfc4648, determinism_contract) classify Local. Falsifications the census caught (kept, not smoothed over): (a) enforcement_live_witness_test classified Local at module grain because its corpus read flows through v2.std.decl_index.decl_facts reflection, not a filesystem_read call - the ambient-read carrier roster must cover the reflection family, and fn-grain reachability is the real successor; (b) filesystem_read_hermetic_witness classifies DataBreadth despite feeding the op a bounded fixture - reachability over-approximates, which is the correct fail-closed DEFAULT for rows with no declared envelope, and the declared InputEnvelope is the override authority (the refused_undeclared_when_envelope_unknown admission law, InputEnvelope P0)."

data witness_cost_locality_precision_frontier: String = "Module grain is the declared v0 precision frontier (DESIGN 5: a structural over-approximation computed as the answer is the model's precision frontier, not an absorption). Known gaps, typed: (1) LayerDepth at module grain conflates importing stage TYPES with executing stage FOLDS - counter-receipt: ci_yaml witnesses flag LayerDepth yet run in ~100ms - so LayerDepth is receipt-only and MUST NOT gate until fn-grain call-graph reachability lands; (2) DataBreadth carrier detection is a declared module roster (filesystem_read callers by grep receipt + the decl_facts reflection home) - a carrier imported for its types only over-flags, resolved by the same fn-grain successor or a declared bounded InputEnvelope on the witness row; (3) this verdict is VALIDATION-tier today (a lens reading facts) - the construction successor is floor admission consuming the verdict so a non-Local row is structurally absent from the per-PR plan, subsuming the witness_exclusion_substrings hand-rows (gunbc.ci_layer_roots) and the entry-text live-scan classifier (cli_run witness_test_fn_uses_live_host_scan, #6224 dissolution). Dissolve-on: fn-grain reachability + InputEnvelope declarations wired into floor admission; then the hand exclusion rows and this v0 roster retire together."

